8:Ruling F2: spec R13 tightened: `added.item.action.commands` is `[]` or equals the done commands; the Python model counts `added` items for kinds that R14 requires complete (not shell_call unless commands non-empty) — fail closed, keeps P1 sound — cost: a real stream with partial commands at added reds (measure in M4).
